# SHA-256 of the certificate every Nagwatch release is signed with.
# Public, and safe to publish: it identifies the key and cannot be used to sign.
# scripts/sign-release.sh refuses to produce an APK signed with anything else.
# Do not change it. A different key means no existing install can upgrade
# (docs/adr/0011).
